ory_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Wc-c_hQK4vFCl9keeVTUZw","review_id":"kQafTeJCRzVPLc2tKYEFAA","date":"2018-06-23T23:50:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9371500611305237,"text_excerpt":"I had dinner here tonight with my husband and the experience was all around wonderful. The first thing we noticed was the excellent service. We were welcomed by the hostess and seated right away. Our waitress came by very soon after we were seated and took our drink order. She mentioned that they had been open less than 2 full days, and if we had any suggestions for drinks or food we'd like to see on the menu, to please let her know. I asked about a sangria, she wrote it down and promised to let the bartender know. We ordered a dozen raw oysters, 1/2 dozen oysters Bienville, and a seafood salad. My husband had a vodka tonic and I had what I think was a honey tea. I think I may be wrong ab..."},{"business_id":"Wc-c_hQK4vFCl9keeVTUZw","review_id":"ii2MCimKsL84_k5jLJMETA","date":"2018-08-07T18:45:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9357373118400574,"text_excerpt":"My dad and I stopped in here for a Friday lunch and since I've been a longtime fan of Felix's in the French Quarter, I was really excited about a Felix's with a little easier access. This location is the old Brisbi's spot and the vibe is pretty much the same: it's right on the lake with a nice view, the space is big and there is indoor and outdoor seating. Because this was a \"splurge\" day for me, I decided to get the fried oyster platter that comes with fries and I subbed my cole slaw for grilled veggies. The oysters were as perfect as they've always been- lightly battered and fried, just enough to still retain their \"oyster\" flavor and not be overwhelmed by the batter. The fries were thi..."},{"business_id":"Wc-c_hQK4vFCl9keeVTUZw","review_id":"rnkZVMWYTD62lOq74Z2I-w","date":"2021-09-30T21:46:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9344736933708191,"text_excerpt":"I've been doing myself a disservice by passing this place for years and just now getting around to trying it. Such a nice restaurant/bar located on the lake. Food, drinks, and vibes were all nice. They have plenty of indoor and outdoor seating. I recommend taking advantage of the outdoor seating when the weather permits, it's so nice on the lake. My friend and I had the Buffalo oysters for an appetizer, they were very tasty and filling, they could have easily been my meal. I had the Felix's pasta for my main dish and I highly recommend it. It was penne pasta with shrimp and oysters, so good. I'm not a beer drinker but they had this Urban South lime cucumber gose beer, very refreshing. The..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Wc-c_hQK4vFCl9keeVTUZw","photo_id":"6yJuDeU46YpLLfOMFb-g_g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/6yJuDeU46YpLLfOMFb-g_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.868735134601593},{"business_id":"Wc-c_hQK4vFCl9keeVTUZw","photo_id":"GJpt26A7TvR3qqKg4VYDkw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GJpt26A7TvR3qqKg4VYDkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8260871171951294},{"business_id":"Wc-c_hQK4vFCl9keeVTUZw","photo_id":"MAqh